{"4396300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SEVENS", "steam_appid": 4396300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4587060], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/266ded3c33f7f279c1e57d8f06a300e9.avif?t=1777747042\" width=1170 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEVENS</strong> is a competitive multiplayer card experience set in a dark underground club atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit at the table, read your opponents, disrupt their strategy, and fight to control the flow of the game — whether you're playing with friends, strangers, or bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat, character interactions, and a gritty retro-styled presentation turn classic card gameplay into a social battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/c0a862960f43076f554542a1dbe2450a.poster.avif?t=1777747042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/c0a862960f43076f554542a1dbe2450a.webm?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/c0a862960f43076f554542a1dbe2450a.mp4?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐<strong>Key Features</strong>⭐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Online multiplayer for up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play with bots or real opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Proximity voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character interaction system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stylized underground club atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Public and private lobbies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮<strong>Available Gamemodes</strong>🎮</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/3cc6e891fbb965e3b143c82ed40312df.poster.avif?t=1777747042\" width=616 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/3cc6e891fbb965e3b143c82ed40312df.webm?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/3cc6e891fbb965e3b143c82ed40312df.mp4?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced competitive card mode for 2–4 players based on the classic Sevens formula. Control the flow of the table, disrupt your opponents, and empty your hand before they do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/3d7e22b7f30d3b4e83eb5f158a9ae9b1.poster.avif?t=1777747042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/3d7e22b7f30d3b4e83eb5f158a9ae9b1.webm?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/3d7e22b7f30d3b4e83eb5f158a9ae9b1.mp4?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯<strong>Objective</strong>🎯<br>Be the first player to discard all your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡<strong>Quick Rules Overview</strong>⚡<br>• Each player starts with 7 cards<br>• Match the top card by <strong>suit</strong> or <strong>rank</strong><br>• If no move is possible, draw from the deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♠️<strong>Special Cards</strong>♠️<br>• <strong>Seven</strong> — Next player draws 3 cards (stackable)<br>• <strong>Joker</strong> — Next player draws 10 cards (stackable)<br>• <strong>Jack</strong> — Change the active suit<br>• <strong>Ace</strong> — All opponents draw 1 card and you play again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/2ca4cd96f45a0d6b080268c74f3abb79.poster.avif?t=1777747042\" width=616 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/2ca4cd96f45a0d6b080268c74f3abb79.webm?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/2ca4cd96f45a0d6b080268c74f3abb79.mp4?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ruthless Sevens-inspired mode where every turn can punish opponents. Match suit or rank, use flex cards to change the active suit, and disrupt the table with draw stacks, swaps, reverses, bans, and targeted “death” attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/e30bf50c72a0099bb29bf769ad52881f.poster.avif?t=1777747042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/e30bf50c72a0099bb29bf769ad52881f.webm?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/e30bf50c72a0099bb29bf769ad52881f.mp4?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯<strong>Objective</strong>🎯<br>Be the first player to discard all your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡<strong>Quick Rules Overview</strong>⚡<br>• Each player starts with 7 cards<br>• Play a card that matches the current suit or rank<br>• Flex cards can be played anytime and let you choose the active suit<br>• Draw Two can be stacked to increase the penalty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♠️<strong>Special Cards</strong>♠️<br>• <strong>Draw Two</strong> — Next player draws 2 (stackable)<br>• <strong>Draw Four</strong> — Next player draws 4<br>• <strong>Flex</strong> — Choose the active suit<br>• <strong>Reverse</strong> — Switch turn direction<br>• <strong>Ban</strong> — Skip the next player<br>• <strong>Swap</strong> — Swap hands with the next player<br>• <strong>Death</strong> — Target a player to reduce their health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>📝 Additional gamemodes are planned during development.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/2c0d84e8c51f4b797ff18381b4b78e81.poster.avif?t=1777747042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/2c0d84e8c51f4b797ff18381b4b78e81.webm?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396300/extras/2c0d84e8c51f4b797ff18381b4b78e81.mp4?t=1777747042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Development</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEVENS</strong> is currently in active development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game modes, characters, and features are planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can follow development by adding the game to your Wishlist.</p>", "about_the_gam